{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112217","id":2964463508,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wsh-U","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112217","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112217.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112217.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112217","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112217/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112217/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112217/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/29fb499adabb67ee2a5917d9a9416aad95c1c129","number":112217,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add retrieval methods to ResourceLoader for querying cached resource paths (C++, C#, GDScript)","user":{"login":"TruelyMostWanted","id":45302427,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzAyNDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45302427?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted","html_url":"https://github.com/TruelyMostWanted","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TruelyMostWanted/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hey, this is my first PR / contribution to the engine 👋\r\n\r\n### Description:\r\nThis PR extends the `ResourceLoader` by 2 private methods (helper methods) and 4 public methods for retrieval of cached paths (all cached paths VS only filtered cached paths), allowing full retrieval of paths in C++, GDScript and C#\r\n\r\n**Note** A resource is considered \"cached\" when it has a ReferenceCount > 0 (assigned to export variables or attributes)\r\n\r\n**Usages:**\r\n```js\r\nextends Node\r\nclass_name GdScriptTestNode\r\n\r\n@export var resources : Array[Resource]\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar allPathsArray = ResourceLoader.get_cached_paths()\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(allPathsArray, \"\\t\"))\r\n\r\n\tvar allPathsDict = ResourceLoader.get_cached_paths_typed();\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(allPathsDict, \"\\t\"));\r\n\r\n\tvar allImgPaths = ResourceLoader.get_cached_paths_by_filter(\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterTarget.FILTER_TARGET_TYPE_HINT,\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterComparator.FILTER_COMP_EQUALS,\r\n\t\t\"Image\"\r\n\t);\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(allImgPaths, \"\\t\"))\r\n\t\r\n\tvar resPaths = ResourceLoader.get_cached_paths_typed_by_filter(\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FilterTarget.FILTER_TARGET_PATH,\r\n\t\tResourceLoader.FILTER_COMP_BEGINS_WITH,\r\n\t\t\"res://new\"\r\n\t);\r\n\tprint(JSON.stringify(resPaths, \"\\t\"))\r\n```\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nusing Godot;\r\nusing Godot.Collections;\r\n\r\n[GlobalClass]\r\npublic partial class TestNode : Node\r\n{\r\n    [Export] public Array<Resource> Resources;\r\n\r\n    public override void _Ready()\r\n    {\r\n        var allPathsArray = ResourceLoader.GetCachedPaths();\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allPathsArray, \"\\t\"));\r\n        \r\n        var allPathsDict  = ResourceLoader.GetCachedPathsTyped();\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allPathsDict, \"\\t\"));\r\n        \r\n        var allImgPaths  = ResourceLoader.GetCachedPathsByFilter(\r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.TypeHint, \r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterComparator.Equals, \r\n            \"Image\"\r\n        );\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allImgPaths, \"\\t\"));\r\n        \r\n        var allResPaths  = ResourceLoader.GetCachedPathsTypedByFilter(\r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterTarget.Path, \r\n            ResourceLoader.FilterComparator.BeginsWith, \r\n            \"res://new\"\r\n        );\r\n        GD.Print(Json.Stringify(allResPaths, \"\\t\"));\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Result:\r\nWith the above GDScript/C# and my list of resources (on the left) assigned to export variables i get the following result:\r\n<img width=\"1127\" height=\"670\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e3c130c-2770-4ee5-bcb7-a79914d5be4e\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nI hope this helps a lot of your projects out! ✨\r\nFeel free to give me any feedback on the idea, the PR, the description/text of the PR and such\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13523*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-30T19:45:24Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T08:47:29Z","closed_at":"2025-11-04T04:03:06Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"51f412285a4afc4a7fb9ac6ffb9a78028a812490","assignee":n